{"about_the_game":"While an old witch was quietly spending her evening playing with her friend the booger, her neighbor decided to play a prank on her and put a curse on the poor and innocent booger. The booger finds itself detached from its old friend, transformed into a spiky booger and taken to a cursed dimension!<br />\r\nThis is how Spiky the booger's adventure begins, and it needs your help! Will you be able to help Spiky through some tough challenges to succeed in lifting the curse?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpiky is a &quot;lose and try again&quot; type of game, you'll have to create a path for Spiky through obstacles using items available in your inventory.<br />\r\n16 levels + 1 final level are available. (Levels are getting bigger and harder).","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Map Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1493660/964f042491324250b8fad2f1244096d103b13cb4.jpg"},{"name":"Second Map Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1493660/a8a06363ba1c286171f0b99ca3813daf71ffe10c.jpg"},{"name":"Third Map Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1493660/696eeb1423359e8e0e16ec01a034e0a540076acf.jpg"},{"name":"Fourth Map Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1493660/098c52dbb9da666344eedd2370425c537b37008f.jpg"},{"name":"Final Map Finished","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1493660/76f5b6e7b5601dc58888e7e49b47b1206e938a6b.jpg"},{"name":"No Time To Waste","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1493660/f5309f0cdf08b20da3ef710390e9db795e65ab66.jpg"},{"name":"Flying Booger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1493660/cf44b2b5de9be28b72382e9cadbde4925f61ab08.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun